  commit 7e4b0c2096be402f51cc8f7d203ebf67cff183d0:
    controls/dev/TabView/TabView.xaml (DefaultTabViewStyle and the implicit style of TabView, the
    implicit style of TabViewListView, TabScrollViewerStyle, TabViewScrollButtonStyle,
    TabViewButtonStyle and TabViewCloseButtonStyle; the resources of
    controls/dev/TabView/TabView_themeresources.xaml are Resources/TabView_themeresources.xaml)
  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. Licensed under the MIT License (see NOTICE.md of the crate).

  FerroUI's TabControl is WinUI's TabView: a strip of tabs over the content of the selected one
  (TabItem is TabViewItem, Controls/TabItem.xaml). FerroUI's tabs cannot be closed, added,
  dragged or reordered, and the TabControl has no strip header or footer.

  Translation notes (docs/porting/winui-theme.md, section 4):
  - The template of TabView is a Grid of the tab strip (TabContainerGrid) over the content
    (TabContentPresenter): a DockPanel with the strip docked at TabStripPlacement. The strip keeps
    the columns of the left content, the tabs and the right content and the bottom border lines
    under them; the column of the add tab button, the button (AddButton with TabViewButtonStyle)
    and the presenters of TabStripHeader and TabStripFooter are left out (FerroUI's TabControl has
    none). The content is the PART_SelectedContentHost FerroUI's TabControl requires, with the
    PART_SelectedContentHost2 of its page transitions, in a Border of the border brush, border
    thickness and corner radius the source binds on TabContentPresenter.
  - TabViewListView (the implicit style of the strip) is not a control of its own: its template
    (a Border, the ScrollViewer with TabScrollViewerStyle, the ItemsPresenter with a 4 px wide
    header and footer that hold the bottom border lines beside the first and the last tab) is
    written into the template, and its ItemsStackPanel is a horizontal StackPanel. The bottom
    border lines of the header and footer are named HeaderBottomBorderLine and
    FooterBottomBorderLine (one name scope holds them with the lines of TabView). The setters of
    the list view are written on its elements (VerticalAlignment, IsTabStop, the scroll bar
    visibilities, BringIntoViewOnFocusChange); its TabNavigation="Once" is the tab navigation
    FerroUI's TabControl sets on its panel. ItemContainerTransitions (AddDeleteThemeTransition,
    ContentThemeTransition, ReorderThemeTransition, EntranceThemeTransition) have no counterpart.
  - The visual states that TabView sets from code (SingleBottomBorderLine of TabView,
    LeftBottomBorderLineShort, RightBottomBorderLineShort and NoBottomBorderLine of the list
    view and of TabScrollViewerStyle) are left out: the lines keep the normal state.
  - TabScrollViewerStyle is a control theme of ScrollViewer. Its scroll buttons are shown by
    ComputedHorizontalScrollBarVisibility in the source and enabled by the code of TabView at the
    ends of the scroll range: here both are MenuScrollingVisibilityConverter of the offset, extent
    and viewport (shown while the tabs overflow, enabled until the end of the range). The
    buttons scroll with the LineLeft and LineRight commands of the scroll viewer (TabView scrolls
    50 px per click in code). The FontIcon glyphs EDD9 and EDDA of the buttons are paths of the
    glyph geometries (G-9), 8 px high (TabViewItemScrollButonFontSize), filled with the foreground
    of the button, which the states of TabViewScrollButtonStyle set with the one of its content
    presenter.
  - The placements of FerroUI that TabView has not: at the bottom the strip is the strip of the
    top turned upside down (its tabs turn their header back, Controls/TabItem.xaml); at the left
    and at the right the tabs are stacked vertically without the bottom border lines, and the
    tabs are drawn as the items of the left pane of NavigationView (Controls/TabItem.xaml), 4 px
    under the top of the strip (the border of RootSplitView and NavigationViewPaneContentGridMargin),
    beside the content grid of NavigationView (NavigationViewContentBackground,
    NavigationViewContentGridBorderBrush, NavigationViewContentGridBorderThickness and
    NavigationViewContentGridCornerRadius, mirrored at the right).
  - KeyboardAcceleratorPlacementMode has no counterpart.
-->
<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/ferroui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
                    xmlns:converters="using:FerroUI.Controls.Converters"
                    x:ClassModifier="internal">
  <Design.PreviewWith>
    <Border Width="480" Padding="20">
      <TabControl Height="180">
        <TabItem Header="Selected">
          <TextBlock Text="The content of the selected tab." Margin="12" />
        </TabItem>
        <TabItem Header="Normal" />
        <TabItem Header="Disabled" IsEnabled="False" />
      </TabControl>
    </Border>
  </Design.PreviewWith>

  <ControlTheme x:Key="TabViewScrollButtonStyle" TargetType="RepeatButton" BasedOn="{StaticResource DefaultRepeatButtonStyle}">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewScrollButtonBackground}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewScrollButtonForeground}" />
    <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{DynamicResource ControlCornerRadius}" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemScrollButonFontSize}" />
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{DynamicResource SymbolThemeFontFamily}" />
    <Setter Property="Width" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemScrollButtonWidth}" />
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemScrollButtonHeight}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewButtonBorderThickness}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewScrollButtonBorderBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <!-- FocusVisualMargin="-3": the focus adorner of DefaultRepeatButtonStyle. -->
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <ContentPresenter x:Name="PART_ContentPresenter"
                          Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                          BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                          BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}"
                          BackgroundSizing="{TemplateBinding BackgroundSizing}"
                          Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                          Content="{TemplateBinding Content}"
                          ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding ContentTemplate}"
                          CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}"
                          FontSize="{TemplateBinding FontSize}"
                          FontFamily="{TemplateBinding FontFamily}"
                          FontWeight="{TemplateBinding FontWeight}"
                          HorizontalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}"
                          VerticalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}" />
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <!-- The foreground of the states is also the foreground of the button, which the glyph of
         its content follows. -->
    <Style Selector="^:pointerover">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewScrollButtonForegroundPointerOver}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:pressed">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewScrollButtonForegroundPressed}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewScrollButtonForegroundDisabled}" />
    </Style>
    <!-- PointerOver -->
    <Style Selector="^:pointerover /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewScrollButtonBackgroundPointerOver}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewScrollButtonForegroundPointerOver}" />
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewScrollButtonBorderBrushPointerOver}" />
    </Style>
    <!-- Pressed -->
    <Style Selector="^:pressed /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewScrollButtonBackgroundPressed}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewScrollButtonForegroundPressed}" />
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewScrollButtonBorderBrushPressed}" />
    </Style>
    <!-- Disabled -->
    <Style Selector="^:disabled /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewScrollButtonBackgroundDisabled}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewScrollButtonForegroundDisabled}" />
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewScrollButtonBorderBrushDisabled}" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <!-- The style of the add tab button (FerroUI's TabControl has none). -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="TabViewButtonStyle" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource DefaultButtonStyle}">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewButtonBackground}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewButtonForeground}" />
    <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{DynamicResource ControlCornerRadius}" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemAddButtonFontSize}" />
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{DynamicResource SymbolThemeFontFamily}" />
    <Setter Property="Width" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemAddButtonWidth}" />
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemAddButtonHeight}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewButtonBorderThickness}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewButtonBorderBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <!-- FocusVisualMargin="-3": the focus adorner of DefaultButtonStyle. -->
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <ContentPresenter x:Name="PART_ContentPresenter"
                          Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                          BackgroundSizing="{TemplateBinding BackgroundSizing}"
                          BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                          BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}"
                          Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                          Content="{TemplateBinding Content}"
                          ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding ContentTemplate}"
                          CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}"
                          FontSize="{TemplateBinding FontSize}"
                          FontFamily="{TemplateBinding FontFamily}"
                          FontWeight="{TemplateBinding FontWeight}"
                          HorizontalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}"
                          VerticalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}" />
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <!-- PointerOver -->
    <Style Selector="^:pointerover /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewButtonBackgroundPointerOver}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewButtonForegroundPointerOver}" />
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewButtonBorderBrushPointerOver}" />
    </Style>
    <!-- Pressed -->
    <Style Selector="^:pressed /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewButtonBackgroundPressed}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewButtonForegroundPressed}" />
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewButtonBorderBrushPressed}" />
    </Style>
    <!-- Disabled -->
    <Style Selector="^:disabled /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewButtonBackgroundDisabled}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewButtonForegroundDisabled}" />
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewButtonBorderBrushDisabled}" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <!-- The style of the close button of a tab (FerroUI's tabs cannot be closed). -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="TabViewCloseButtonStyle" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource DefaultButtonStyle}">
    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{DynamicResource SymbolThemeFontFamily}" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemHeaderCloseFontSize}" />
    <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{DynamicResource ControlCornerRadius}" />
    <Setter Property="Width" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemHeaderCloseButtonWidth}" />
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemHeaderCloseButtonHeight}" />
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemHeaderCloseButtonBackground}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemHeaderCloseButtonForeground}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemHeaderCloseButtonBorderBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemHeaderCloseButtonBorderThickness}" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
    <!-- FocusVisualMargin="-3": the focus adorner of DefaultButtonStyle. -->
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <ContentPresenter x:Name="PART_ContentPresenter"
                          BackgroundSizing="{TemplateBinding BackgroundSizing}"
                          Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                          BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                          BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}"
                          Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                          ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding ContentTemplate}"
                          Content="{TemplateBinding Content}"
                          CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}"
                          HorizontalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}"
                          VerticalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}" />
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <!-- PointerOver -->
    <Style Selector="^:pointerover /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemHeaderCloseButtonBackgroundPointerOver}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemHeaderCloseButtonForegroundPointerOver}" />
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemHeaderCloseButtonBorderBrushPointerOver}" />
    </Style>
    <!-- Pressed -->
    <Style Selector="^:pressed /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemHeaderCloseButtonBackgroundPressed}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemHeaderCloseButtonForegroundPressed}" />
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewItemHeaderCloseButtonBorderBrushPressed}" />
    </Style>
    <!-- The source has no Disabled state: the brushes of the control stay. -->
    <Style Selector="^:disabled /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{TemplateBinding Background}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{TemplateBinding Foreground}" />
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <ControlTheme x:Key="TabScrollViewerStyle" TargetType="ScrollViewer">
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Border x:Name="Root"
                Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}">
          <Grid>
            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" MinWidth="2" />
              <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
              <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
            <Border x:Name="LeftBottomBorderLine"
                    Background="{DynamicResource TabViewBorderBrush}"
                    Height="1"
                    VerticalAlignment="Bottom" />
            <Border x:Name="RightBottomBorderLine"
                    Grid.Column="2"
                    Background="{DynamicResource TabViewBorderBrush}"
                    Height="1"
                    VerticalAlignment="Bottom" />
            <Border x:Name="ScrollDecreaseButtonContainer"
                    Padding="{DynamicResource TabViewItemLeftScrollButtonContainerPadding}"
                    VerticalAlignment="Bottom">
              <Border.IsVisible>
                <MultiBinding Converter="{x:Static converters:MenuScrollingVisibilityConverter.Instance}"
                              ConverterParameter="-1">
                  <Binding RelativeSource="{RelativeSource TemplatedParent}" Path="HorizontalScrollBarVisibility" />
                  <Binding RelativeSource="{RelativeSource TemplatedParent}" Path="Offset.X" />
                  <Binding RelativeSource="{RelativeSource TemplatedParent}" Path="Extent.Width" />
                  <Binding RelativeSource="{RelativeSource TemplatedParent}" Path="Viewport.Width" />
                </MultiBinding>
              </Border.IsVisible>
              <RepeatButton x:Name="ScrollDecreaseButton"
                            Theme="{StaticResource TabViewScrollButtonStyle}"
                            IsTabStop="False"
                            Delay="50"
                            Interval="100"
                            Command="{Binding LineLeft, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                <RepeatButton.IsEnabled>
                  <MultiBinding Converter="{x:Static converters:MenuScrollingVisibilityConverter.Instance}"
                                ConverterParameter="0">
                    <Binding RelativeSource="{RelativeSource TemplatedParent}" Path="HorizontalScrollBarVisibility" />
                    <Binding RelativeSource="{RelativeSource TemplatedParent}" Path="Offset.X" />
                    <Binding RelativeSource="{RelativeSource TemplatedParent}" Path="Extent.Width" />
                    <Binding RelativeSource="{RelativeSource TemplatedParent}" Path="Viewport.Width" />
                  </MultiBinding>
                </RepeatButton.IsEnabled>
                <Path Data="{StaticResource GlyphGeometryEDD9}"
                      Fill="{Binding $parent[RepeatButton].Foreground}"
                      Stretch="Uniform"
                      Height="{StaticResource TabViewItemScrollButonFontSize}" />
              </RepeatButton>
            </Border>
            <ScrollContentPresenter x:Name="PART_ContentPresenter"
                                    Grid.Column="1"
                                    Padding="1,0,0,0"
                                    ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding ContentTemplate}">
              <ScrollContentPresenter.GestureRecognizers>
                <ScrollGestureRecognizer CanHorizontallyScroll="{Binding CanHorizontallyScroll, ElementName=PART_ContentPresenter}"
                                         CanVerticallyScroll="{Binding CanVerticallyScroll, ElementName=PART_ContentPresenter}"
                                         Offset="{Binding Offset, ElementName=PART_ContentPresenter}"
                                         Viewport="{Binding Viewport, ElementName=PART_ContentPresenter}"
                                         Extent="{Binding Extent, ElementName=PART_ContentPresenter}" />
              </ScrollContentPresenter.GestureRecognizers>
            </ScrollContentPresenter>
            <Border x:Name="ScrollIncreaseButtonContainer"
                    Grid.Column="2"
                    Padding="{DynamicResource TabViewItemRightScrollButtonContainerPadding}"
                    VerticalAlignment="Bottom">
              <Border.IsVisible>
                <MultiBinding Converter="{x:Static converters:MenuScrollingVisibilityConverter.Instance}"
                              ConverterParameter="-1">
                  <Binding RelativeSource="{RelativeSource TemplatedParent}" Path="HorizontalScrollBarVisibility" />
                  <Binding RelativeSource="{RelativeSource TemplatedParent}" Path="Offset.X" />
                  <Binding RelativeSource="{RelativeSource TemplatedParent}" Path="Extent.Width" />
                  <Binding RelativeSource="{RelativeSource TemplatedParent}" Path="Viewport.Width" />
                </MultiBinding>
              </Border.IsVisible>
              <RepeatButton x:Name="ScrollIncreaseButton"
                            Theme="{StaticResource TabViewScrollButtonStyle}"
                            IsTabStop="False"
                            Delay="50"
                            Interval="100"
                            Command="{Binding LineRight, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                <RepeatButton.IsEnabled>
                  <MultiBinding Converter="{x:Static converters:MenuScrollingVisibilityConverter.Instance}"
                                ConverterParameter="100">
                    <Binding RelativeSource="{RelativeSource TemplatedParent}" Path="HorizontalScrollBarVisibility" />
                    <Binding RelativeSource="{RelativeSource TemplatedParent}" Path="Offset.X" />
                    <Binding RelativeSource="{RelativeSource TemplatedParent}" Path="Extent.Width" />
                    <Binding RelativeSource="{RelativeSource TemplatedParent}" Path="Viewport.Width" />
                  </MultiBinding>
                </RepeatButton.IsEnabled>
                <Path Data="{StaticResource GlyphGeometryEDDA}"
                      Fill="{Binding $parent[RepeatButton].Foreground}"
                      Stretch="Uniform"
                      Height="{StaticResource TabViewItemScrollButonFontSize}" />
              </RepeatButton>
            </Border>
          </Grid>
        </Border>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
  </ControlTheme>

  <ControlTheme x:Key="DefaultTabViewStyle" TargetType="TabControl">
    <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Top" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewHeaderPadding}" />
    <Setter Property="IsTabStop" Value="False" />
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource TabViewBackground}" />
    <!-- The ItemsStackPanel of TabViewListView. -->
    <Setter Property="ItemsPanel">
      <ItemsPanelTemplate>
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" />
      </ItemsPanelTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <DockPanel>
          <Border x:Name="TabContainerGrid"
                  DockPanel.Dock="{TemplateBinding TabStripPlacement}"
                  Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                  RenderTransformOrigin="50%,50%">
            <Grid>
              <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" MinWidth="2" />
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
              </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <Border x:Name="LeftBottomBorderLine"
                      Background="{DynamicResource TabViewBorderBrush}"
                      Height="1"
                      VerticalAlignment="Bottom" />
              <Border x:Name="RightBottomBorderLine"
                      Grid.Column="2"
                      Background="{DynamicResource TabViewBorderBrush}"
                      Height="1"
                      VerticalAlignment="Bottom" />
              <!-- TabViewListView -->
              <Border x:Name="TabListView"
                      Grid.Column="1"
                      HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                      VerticalAlignment="Top">
                <ScrollViewer x:Name="ScrollViewer"
                              Theme="{StaticResource TabScrollViewerStyle}"
                              HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Auto"
                              VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled"
                              BringIntoViewOnFocusChange="True"
                              IsTabStop="False">
                  <DockPanel x:Name="TabsItemsPresenter" Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}">
                    <Panel x:Name="TabsItemsPresenterHeader" DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="4">
                      <Border x:Name="HeaderBottomBorderLine"
                              Background="{DynamicResource TabViewBorderBrush}"
                              Width="4"
                              Height="1"
                              VerticalAlignment="Bottom"
                              HorizontalAlignment="Left" />
                    </Panel>
                    <Panel x:Name="TabsItemsPresenterFooter" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Width="4">
                      <Border x:Name="FooterBottomBorderLine"
                              Background="{DynamicResource TabViewBorderBrush}"
                              Width="4"
                              Height="1"
                              VerticalAlignment="Bottom"
                              HorizontalAlignment="Right" />
                    </Panel>
                    <ItemsPresenter Name="PART_ItemsPresenter"
                                    ItemsPanel="{TemplateBinding ItemsPanel}" />
                  </DockPanel>
                </ScrollViewer>
              </Border>
            </Grid>
          </Border>
          <Border x:Name="TabContentPresenter"
                  BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                  BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}"
                  CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}">
            <Panel ClipToBounds="True">
              <ContentPresenter Name="PART_SelectedContentHost2"
                                HorizontalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}"
                                VerticalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}"
                                IsVisible="False" />
              <ContentPresenter Name="PART_SelectedContentHost"
                                HorizontalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}"
                                VerticalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}" />
            </Panel>
          </Border>
        </DockPanel>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>

    <!-- The strip at the bottom: the strip of the top turned upside down. -->
    <Style Selector="^[TabStripPlacement=Bottom] /template/ Border#TabContainerGrid">
      <Setter Property="RenderTransform" Value="scaleY(-1)" />
    </Style>

    <!-- The strip at the left or the right: the tabs stacked vertically, scrolled vertically,
         without the bottom border lines. -->
    <Style Selector="^[TabStripPlacement=Left]">
      <!-- The pane of NavigationView: its items 3 px under the top of the pane
           (NavigationViewPaneContentGridMargin) and the 1 px border of RootSplitView. -->
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0,4,0,0" />
      <!-- The content is the content grid of NavigationView beside its pane
           (NavigationViewContentBackground, the border and the corner of ContentGrid). -->
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#TabContentPresenter">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource NavigationViewContentBackground}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource NavigationViewContentGridBorderBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="{DynamicResource NavigationViewContentGridBorderThickness}" />
        <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{DynamicResource NavigationViewContentGridCornerRadius}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ ItemsPresenter#PART_ItemsPresenter > StackPanel">
        <Setter Property="Orientation" Value="Vertical" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ ScrollViewer#ScrollViewer">
        <Setter Property="HorizontalScrollBarVisibility" Value="Disabled" />
        <Setter Property="VerticalScrollBarVisibility" Value="Auto" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#TabListView">
        <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#LeftBottomBorderLine, ^ /template/ Border#RightBottomBorderLine, ^ /template/ Panel#TabsItemsPresenterHeader, ^ /template/ Panel#TabsItemsPresenterFooter">
        <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="False" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^[TabStripPlacement=Right]">
      <!-- The pane of NavigationView: its items 3 px under the top of the pane
           (NavigationViewPaneContentGridMargin) and the 1 px border of RootSplitView. -->
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0,4,0,0" />
      <!-- The content is the content grid of NavigationView beside its pane
           (NavigationViewContentBackground, the border and the corner of ContentGrid, mirrored). -->
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#TabContentPresenter">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource NavigationViewContentBackground}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource NavigationViewContentGridBorderBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0,1,1,0" />
        <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="0,8,0,0" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ ItemsPresenter#PART_ItemsPresenter > StackPanel">
        <Setter Property="Orientation" Value="Vertical" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ ScrollViewer#ScrollViewer">
        <Setter Property="HorizontalScrollBarVisibility" Value="Disabled" />
        <Setter Property="VerticalScrollBarVisibility" Value="Auto" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#TabListView">
        <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#LeftBottomBorderLine, ^ /template/ Border#RightBottomBorderLine, ^ /template/ Panel#TabsItemsPresenterHeader, ^ /template/ Panel#TabsItemsPresenterFooter">
        <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="False" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type TabControl}" TargetType="TabControl" BasedOn="{StaticResource DefaultTabViewStyle}" />
</ResourceDictionary>
